  "description": "ToolUp.Graph in-memory default — the zero-dependency IGraphStore (GP 2 floor). Per-scope immutable adjacency-list snapshots plus a bounded openCypher subset interpreter (MATCH / WHERE / variable-length paths / RETURN / ORDER BY / LIMIT) that throws CypherSubsetException for anything beyond the documented portability floor. For development, tests, and small single-instance deployments; engine companions (Kùzu / Neo4j / AGE) bring durable / distributed storage and full Cypher.",
